{"parentUuid":"9926d244-3892-4bef-8d81-d05f78e86b9c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLfXKojetdPc3MrpV2BU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The #758 re-review is posted on the PR as request changes, and CI agrees: both required `test-matrix` checks are red at its head.\n\n- **Fixed:** restart detection for goals now works. A goal left active by a dead process comes back paused with a reason, already paused, completed or cancelled goals are left alone, and a goal whose owner is still alive is not touched. The new tests fail when the logic is removed.\n- **New blocker:** the same change breaks the shared operation path. `operation_entry_integrity.test.ts` fails at this head and passes on the release branch. Operations are planned as running with no owner recorded, and the new rule treats any such operation as stale, so a freshly planned operation can be paused before it has ever run. The comment gives three ways to fix it.\n- **Limits the docs should state:** a reused process id reads as alive, and state from another host is never paused.\n\nThe release branch CI is green at `24992b1f`. The #760 re-review is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2244,"cache_read_input_tokens":496891,"output_tokens":312,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2244,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":496891,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2244},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"