{"parentUuid":"54c6d750-652d-4a8e-a895-f40e47ea0d40","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChLojUUeY5mayyKHgL1u8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both extra suites pass on the current release tip (`6b916195`): the real-server LSP suite and the real-project smoke. Together with the regular CI, the branch is green on everything that can be run against it today.\n\nThe queue is otherwise quiet. One PR is open, #758 (PA-3), unchanged at the head with changes requested and red CI.\n\nThere is nothing further I can do toward landing v1.3.0 inside the merge, review and CI role until something changes:\n\n- **Codex's side:** fix #758; build or hand off the unbuilt units (PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2); finish GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists and the six VR-2 follow-ups.\n- **Your side:** decide which of those roll to v1.4, then give the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the release-candidate tag.\n\nIf you choose the thin release candidate that the readiness inventory proposes (what has landed, with GV-1 and GV-5 marked partial in the notes), say so and I'll prepare the version bump, changelog and release notes as a PR for you to approve."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_read_input_tokens":544779,"output_tokens":389,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":544779,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":n