{"parentUuid":"5c98c78a-d754-4af8-960b-aa03efd47233","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMCkgWAMwXWW9aYxRNn8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#770 is merged and the release branch is green at `5abbc4cb`. No PRs are open.\n\n**The verifier-orphan work (#767, #770)**\n- **The flake:** a cancellation test timed out once in CI, waiting 60 s for a verifier process to be gone.\n- **My first diagnosis was wrong in part.** I fixed what I thought was the cause in #767, working from reading alone. Another session merged it before its review finished. The review then found the worker does check for cancellation between verifier runs, and reproduced a different window with a cancel loop.\n- **The real cause:** a sandbox process forked just after the kill listed the process tree, or handed to init when its parent died of SIGTERM, was out of reach of every later stage and ran until the verifier's own deadline.\n- **The fix (#770):**\n  - every signal stage stops the process tree before listing and signalling it;\n  - every process seen is remembered by pid and start time;\n  - survivors are swept when a cancelled worker exits.\n- **Measured:** about 1 orphan in 70 cancellations before the fix. After it, none in 610 runs across my batches and the reviewer's.\n- **Review of #770:** it found three more defects, all fixed before merge. The most serious was that the kill could signal the worker's pid after the worker had exited, when the pid might belong to another process. Those three fixes were small and followed the reviewer's stated remedy, but no second reader re-read them.\n\n**Also merged since my last full update:** #766 (complexity gate) and #769 (docs) by me; #765 and #768 (docs) by another session. #768 contains one wrong sentence, saying lint runs in the packaging job; I noted the correction on the PR.\n\n**What still stands between here and landing v1.3.0, unchanged**\n- **Unbuilt:** PF-3, PF-4, SB-1, MT-2, BG-1, BG-2, HK-1 to HK-3, PA-2.\n- **Unfinished:** GV-1 slices 3–4, the GV-5 allowlists, the six VR-2 follow-ups.\n- **Yours:** which units roll to v1.4, the go-ahead for the merge to `main` and the release-candidate tag, and who holds the merge queue."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_read_input_tokens":666982,"output_tokens":734,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":666982,"cache_creation_input_tokens":387,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":387},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChMCkgJm1ZzRd72XhrtMT","requestRef":"0004be0e-e2c7-4d9e-9916-00a5fb3c70b9","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"a105b47d-efc6-45ba-88c7-26164cca9b71","timestamp":"2026-11-24T05:30:28.293Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
