t` is the bundle's creation time.\n- Reporting a mismatch as a match fails the binding test.\n\n**Tests at `7e58def9`:** `audit_bundle` 25/0, `audit_schema` 7/0, `leak_guard` 6/0, `verify_hostile` 46/0, `check_requirements` 28/0, `tsc` clean, `check_invariants` passes.\n\n**Not checked:** a byte-flip of the new file followed by `audit verify` (by reading it is covered by the manifest), an older `audit verify` on a new bundle, symlink and submodule digests, the complexity gate.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3026bfa0-5951-4b5e-93fe-b5de0116ab45","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
