{"parentUuid":"ea9126b4-1373-475e-a785-31e84feb890b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMbvtgLsamuAsZvib2wQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The second item on your list is built and in review: GV-1 slices 3–4 and the GV-5 allowlists are open as #778.\n\n**What #778 does**\n- **Allowlists enforced:** an MCP server or plugin outside the allowlist no longer starts or loads. Workspace-level definitions can be switched off, including ones reached through a symlink.\n- **\"Always approve\" gap closed:** under a policy that forbids auto mode, an \"always\" answer approves only that one call. The fix is in the sidecar, so the TUI needed no change. The line-mode REPL had the same gap although the docs said it didn't; that's fixed too.\n- **`nexus verify`** refuses `--yes`, `--sandbox none` and `--sandbox-network` when policy forbids them.\n- **New commands:** `nexus policy show` and `nexus policy check`, plus four doctor findings. `doctor --fix` never touches a policy file.\n\n**Decisions and limits to know**\n- I left out `nexus policy approve` on purpose: it would be a second approval path that a model could run. `nexus trust` stays the only one.\n- Still marked \"not yet\" in the docs: `egress.secret_destinations`, and the sandbox itself consulting `sandbox.forbid_network`. The plan puts both in a later slice, so strictly GV-1 has a slice 5 beyond what you listed. Tell me if you want it in this release.\n\n**Test status, honestly**\n- The four new test files and 465 existing managed-policy tests pass locally.\n- Three large files didn't finish cleanly on this host because of the load from five parallel builds: `sidecar` (8 timing failures of 65), `context_convergence` (cut off after 15 minutes, nothing failed) and `doctor` (the same 11 failures as the base branch). CI will settle those.\n\nAn independent review of #778 is running, with a brief to find a way around the allowlists and the \"always\" fix.\n\nElsewhere: #774 was merged by the other session after my accept, with green checks. BG-1, HK-1, PF-4 and SB-1 are still building."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3528,"cache_read_input_tokens":867579,"output_tokens":683,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3528,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":683,"cache_read_input_tokens":867579,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3528},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChMbvtSD3HUfYBZjm1wxX","requestRef":"63d44ece-a7a9-4b5e-9994-6afa0d8f316d","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"071f29a4-1919-4461-b8ad-edfce79e4861","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:34:23.349Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
