test passes.\n- **Docs:** the four corrections are in `docs/HOOKS.md`.\n- **Subagent test:** added and passing.\n\n## Counts\n- `hooks_self_approval` 6 and `hooks_cli` 10, each 3 runs in a row.\n- The other hook files, `leak_guard`, `approval_policy`, `check_requirements`, the `managed_policy_*` files, `policy_cli`, `security`, `workspace_trust`, `verification_guard`, `spine` and `examples` all pass with 0 failures.\n- `tsc`, the complexity gate, `check_invariants` and `check_doc_versions` are clean.\n\n## Open\n- The unsandboxed fake-terminal and direct-store-write route above.\n- Files a pinned script sources are not covered.\n- An operator hook that names a workspace-relative program is not pinned; the docs advise against it.\n- Notices for unapproved project hooks still appear on the first tool call, not at session start.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>518685</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>23</tool_uses><duration_ms>815749</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"02b4ac02-1ef6-41db-a4ca-c264e3e4beea","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:10:28.014Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mwutiput-f8c57880"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPromptId":"4a863a3c-1cfc-438f-8688-509b0dad2291","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":40,"turnIndex":270},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
