c's wording implies more than is done.\n- **Denial framing and old trust records: closed (run).**\n\n**Not blocking:** the pinned files are hashed once per call and the interpreter re-reads the script later (a window only a concurrent unsandboxed process can use); the state is re-hashed on every call (up to 32 files of 1 MiB); two mutations survive (dropping the stdout-terminal check; dropping the 'approved file no longer named' comparison).\n\n**Tests at this head, 0 failures:** eleven hook files (88 tests), \\`content_trust\\` 7, \\`strict_json\\` 9, \\`doctor_hooks\\` 5, \\`security\\` 14, \\`security_gates\\` 10, \\`workspace_trust\\` 5, \\`managed_policy_enforcement\\` 113, \\`approval_policy\\` 16, \\`leak_guard\\` 6, \\`check_requirements\\` 28; \\`tsc\\`, the complexity gate and \\`check_invariants\\` pass.\" | tail -1","description":"Post the re-review verdict on PR 782"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2747,"cache_read_input_tokens":147016,"output_tokens":2829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2747,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2829,"cache_read_input_tokens":147016,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2747},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.5.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.8.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"},{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.8.content.1","reason