{"parentUuid":"b9a749a3-bb95-401a-8368-90626840fdb3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMyvA6pu7AKpD6CpLGGr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The re-review of #782 (hooks) came back request changes again: two of the three blockers are closed, the third only partly.\n\n- **Self-approval:** closed. 124 attempts through the agent's file tools never changed the trust store or the operator hooks file, and `nexus hooks approve` writes nothing without a terminal.\n- **Workspace set to the home directory:** closed.\n- **Script pinning:** still open for four command forms. After approval, the agent could replace a workspace file and the hook ran the new content with no notice when the command used a directory argument, `sh -c` or `bash -c` with a script path, or `node --require=./file`. Plain script arguments are pinned correctly.\n\nThe verdict is posted on the PR and the fix is being made on the branch now: a project hook will be accepted only if every argument is either a pinned file or clearly not a reference into the workspace, and inline code is refused. #782 stays unmerged until that is in and re-reviewed.\n\nPA-2 and MT-2 slice 1 are still building."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2977,"cache_read_input_tokens":149763,"output_tokens":331,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2977,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":149763,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2977,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2977},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"c