; examples/embed/embed.mjs:36-38, docs/EMBEDDING.md:34, examples/embed/README.md:18-19; add a test that a model-declared verifier request is denied). #782 HK-1: two review rounds; round-2 fixes (commit a69316624: every arg pinned or refused, inline code refused) pushed with release merged in, NEEDS a third independent re-review before merge. #784 MT-2 slice 1 (tests/fixtures only) pushed, checks pending; merge when green; then MT-2 slices 2-4. PA-2 implementer was mid-slice-1 in ~/nexus-wt/pa2 (local commits only; resume or check `git log`). #780 BG-1 (Codex) had a new head 791303a1, unreviewed. Not started: BG-2, HK-2, HK-3, PF-3; SB-1 slices 2-3 with Codex. MT-2 characterization flagged likely defects (read-only mode lets run_command through; null args throw TypeError; unknown tool asks approval before FAIL-001): raise as issues/fix.\nEOF","description":"Resolve the README conflict keeping both rows, push the hooks branch, and record the pause state in the claims log and progress notes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":857,"cache_read_input_tokens":166423,"output_tokens":1428,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":92},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":857,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1428,"cache_read_input_tokens":166423,"cache_creation_input_tokens":857,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":857},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":10962,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01CNEkseegm7Bb9xpPDaowdG":{"command":"cd ~/nexus-wt/hk1 && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np='examples/README.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns=re.