{"parentUuid":"63c509e8-ee71-4cae-b165-62bfc41e2340","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChN1CFxNHGYCHWJNYXQC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your usage limit was reached, so I'm stopping here; v1.3.0 is not landed yet.\n\n**Done this stretch**\n- **#783** (policy follow-ups) is merged into `release/v1.3.0`, and release CI was green on that merge (`96e8f24f`).\n- **#782** (HK-1 hooks) went through two independent reviews. The second round of fixes is pushed with the release branch merged in (`90d2347e`): every argument of a project hook is now either pinned by hash or refused, and inline code is refused.\n- **#784** (MT-2 slice 1) is open: characterization tests and fixtures only, no source change, with the release branch merged in.\n- Reviews are posted on #779, #782 and #783.\n\n**Needs your attention**\n- **#779 (Codex's PF-4) was merged by another session over my open change request.** Its embedding example and docs snippet approve any verifier request, including ones the model declares, and that is now on the release branch. I created a worktree for the fix but have not edited anything yet.\n- **#782 must not be merged yet.** The latest fixes have not had their third independent review.\n\n**Left to do**\n- Fix the #779 example, re-review #782, and merge #784 once its checks are green.\n- PA-2: the build was mid-slice with nothing committed at the last check, local only, and will be cut off by the limit.\n- MT-2 slices 2–4, BG-2, HK-2, HK-3 and PF-3 are not started.\n- Codex still has BG-1 (#780, new head, last seen red and unreviewed) and SB-1 slices 2–3.\n- The MT-2 tests pinned several behaviours that look like defects and need raising (for example, read-only mode still lets `run_command` through).\n- After all of that: the merge to `main`, the RC and the release.\n\nThe pause state is in the claims log and my progress notes, so I can pick up from here when the limit resets."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2200,"cache_read_input_tokens":167280,"output_tokens":627,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2200,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":167280,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2200,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2200},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChN1CFjDuS2PNo2zBCBby","requestRef":"7eb394f6-f2e7-498e-a28d-f23a0eec7e45","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"8bf2170d-4f3e-4cd2-91d8-6abfe7b9abd2","timestamp":"2026-11-24T15:39:28.628Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
