uard`, `check_requirements`; `cd cli && npx tsc --noEmit -p .`; the complexity gate; `node scripts/check_invariants.mjs`. Mutations (copy aside, restore from the copy; never `git checkout`): remove the token check, the controller-only check, the `always` refusal, the 0600 chmod, the dir-mode check, the stale-sweep uid check: each must fail a test (a hang counts as caught; note it).\n\nRules: do NOT edit ~/nexus-code or existing worktrees. `git -C ~/nexus-code fetch origin && git -C ~/nexus-code worktree add --detach ~/nexus-wt/rev797 <full sha>`; `cp -a ~/nexus-code/cli/node_modules ~/nexus-wt/rev797/cli/`; `mkdir -p ~/nexus-wt/rev797/core/target/release && cp ~/nexus-wt/ls1b/core/target/release/{harness-core,nexus-tui} ~/nexus-wt/rev797/core/target/release/`. Tests: `cd ~/nexus-wt/rev797/cli && TMPDIR=/dev/shm HOME=$(mktemp -d) node --import tsx --test test/<name>.test.ts 2>&1 | tail -20`. Never read or write the real ~/.nexus, ~/.config/nexus, /etc/nexus. No network, no inference. Stop processes by their own pid, never `pkill -f`; leave no listeners behind. No commits, pushes or GitHub comments. At the end remove probe files and `git -C ~/nexus-code worktree remove --force ~/nexus-wt/rev797`. Shell is zsh (`bash -c` for loops); output passes through `rtk` (prefix `rtk proxy` if filtered); a safety check blocks scripts containing `rm`.\n\nReport under 500 words: verdict (ACCEPT / ACCEPT WITH FOLLOW-UPS / REQUEST CHANGES) at the exact SHA; findings with file:line, run-or-read, blocking or not (any route by which a non-operator client or a model command gains controller rights, allow-always, auto, or reads the token, is blocking); test counts; mutation results; what you did not check."}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChNNSkoJ2MMpdiu8jKFUi","requestRef":"15216678-91f7-4086-876f-77c32a52e3ac","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a44487e-2b6e-41cc-bfda-de88e8942f74","timestamp":"2026-11-24T20:18:16.183Z","a