{"parentUuid":"fb7f932a-00ee-4506-891d-23947e0accaa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNTPY35WAvg2TgjM31m3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The re-review of #797 (PF-3) came back request changes at `03d8ea1b5`. The original blocker is closed: with real bwrap, a sandboxed command could no longer read the socket token or connect, in both sandbox profiles, for every socket-directory location I tried.\n\nOne narrow route is still open. Two containment checks (`sandbox.ts:275` and `sidecar.ts:1688`) treat any path segment that merely starts with `..` as outside the workspace. If an operator points `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` into the workspace at a segment such as `..hid`, `--listen` is not refused. In the read-only sandbox profile a sandboxed command then read the token file. It needs an unusual operator setup, so I rate it low likelihood, but a sandboxed command reading the token is blocking.\n\nThe review is posted on the PR. I've sent the builder these fixes:\n- A correct \"outside the workspace\" test in both places, with a `..x` directory test and an end-to-end refusal test.\n- A search for other `startsWith(\"..\")` checks in files this PR touches.\n- The socket directory is created only after the workspace refusal, so a refused one isn't left behind.\n- The refusal test must fail with an assertion instead of hanging for 240 seconds.\n\n#797 stays unmerged until those are in and checked. The BG-2 review (#799) is still running.\n\nv1.3.0 is not landed. The merge to `main` and the release haven't started, and HK-3 and MT-2 slices 2–4 are still unclaimed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2780,"cache_read_input_tokens":239808,"output_tokens":503,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2780,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":503,"cache_read_input_tokens":239808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2780,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2780},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChNTPXqg8Q5WMVwbm6XKx","requestRef":"d9dfb21e-a9a0-4be7-aee6-0fd04d1cc739","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"a32efe45-3fa0-43bc-b3e9-124e47bc50e9","timestamp":"2026-11-24T21:22:56.067Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
