 computes the path without touching the file system, and `realpathAllowingMissing()` resolves it.\n\n**New tests**\n- `sandbox_confine.test.ts` (19 tests): `isPathWithin` on `..hid`, `..`, sibling prefixes, and both bwrap profiles masking `&lt;ws&gt;/..hid`.\n- `sidecar_socket.test.ts` (13 tests): end-to-end for `XDG_RUNTIME_DIR` of `&lt;ws&gt;/run` and `&lt;ws&gt;/..hid`. Each must exit 1 and print no `listening` line, and the `nexus` directory must not exist afterwards. It races the exit against a 20-second timer and fails with a clear message instead of hanging for 240 seconds. The timer is cleared after the race; otherwise it tripped `leak_guard`.\n- Both files pass on their own; `sidecar_socket` passed three consecutive runs.\n\n**Other `startsWith(\"..\")` sites (reported only, not changed)**\n\n| File | Lines |\n|---|---|\n| `browser.ts` | 100, 120, 265 |\n| `core/authority.ts` | 637, 657, 692 |\n| `core/candidate.ts` | 1089 |\n| `core/observation_identity.ts` | 70, 93 |\n| `lsp.ts` | 406 |\n| `safe_fs.ts` | 39 |\n| `security.ts` | 797, 821, 1012 |\n| `skills.ts` | 332 |\n| `tester.ts` | 446 |\n| `workspace_trust.ts` | 39 |\n| `worktrunk/copy.ts` | 58 |\n| `worktrunk/paths.ts` | 122 |\n\nNone are in files this PR touches.\n\n**Still to do**\n- Read the mutation results. The planned mutations are the old `startsWith` check (unit and end-to-end), creating the directory before the check, and removing the refusal.\n- Run the full gate list, with changed files three times each.\n- Commit as `fix(pf3): ...` with the Fable co-author line, then push with a plain `git push origin v1/pf3-control-socket`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>282910</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>5</tool_uses><duration_ms>191907</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}]}}
