{"parentUuid":"6c34e228-9a92-4c21-903f-7bfddf1e8b76","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNTerKqf37oFj795KiF1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The PF-3 builder has written the `..hid` containment fix but not committed or pushed it. It is waiting on its own mutation run, then the full gate list, before it pushes to #797.\n\nThe containment check now lives in one exported function (`isPathWithin`), and `--listen` refuses a socket directory inside the workspace before creating anything. The refusal test now fails with a clear message after 20 seconds instead of hanging for 240.\n\nThe builder found 12 other files with the same prefix-check pattern (17 sites), none in files this PR touches. I filed issue #800 to cover them. Whether any of them is a real bypass has not been reviewed, so I'm not treating it as a v1.3.0 gate.\n\n#797 stays unmerged until the fix is pushed and re-checked. The BG-2 review (#799) is still running. v1.3.0 is not landed, and the merge to `main` and the release haven't started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1843,"cache_read_input_tokens":244542,"output_tokens":296,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1843,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":296,"cache_read_input_tokens":244542,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1843,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1843},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChNTer7BohkpaUQsq9YuB","requestRef":"054676e3-ba7e-4ccf-96f3-113bf4d56a4e","requestedModel