en code without approval, inside the sandbox, with the advice to use a narrow verifier for untrusted repositories.\n\n**Tests added**\n- A scripted run that ends REGRESSION_FREE and must show `PASSED`, never NOT_RUN.\n- Cron floor and never-matches tables in `schedule.test.ts`, and a 31 February row in `schedule_cli.test.ts`.\n- A runner test refusing a request that carries `rm -rf /` as its verifier.\n\n**Mutations:** 4 guards (the REGRESSION_FREE branch, the cross-day gap check, the never-matches check, the request-verifier check), each caught by its tests.\n\n**Runs:** every `schedule*` file and `unattended_verifier` passed three times. The BG-1 files, `fault_kill_mid_tool_call`, `protocol_schema`, `run_json_contract`, `leak_guard` and `security` passed once, and the example tests passed after a rebuild. `tsc`, the complexity gate, `check_invariants`, `check_doc_versions`, `check_requirements` and the three schema `--check` generators are clean.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>497970</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>26</tool_uses><duration_ms>1671448</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"65eec0c4-954a-421b-8cf5-0b053bba130c","timestamp":"2026-11-24T23:00:14.511Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mwv9sigz-af55fa03"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPromptId":"aac5bc77-7cbb-4a24-9dad-12eb33149bbd","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":40,"turnIndex":290},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
