{"parentUuid":"63d015ee-2b55-4d36-a6c3-93208fbba998","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNbm3AJyVwygydUWHQzc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three reviews and one build are running in parallel, and none has reported yet. v1.3.0 is not landed. Release tip is `d9b0f5a6`, and I haven't yet seen release CI at that tip finish.\n\n- **MT-2 slices 2–3 (tool registry):** claimed and being built. The slice-1 characterization tests from #784 must pass without edits. Slice 4, the dispatch split with the complexity-baseline move, is not started and needs a claims-log announcement and your acknowledgement first.\n- **HK-1:** the hooks code that merged on 2026-11-24 at 18:03Z is under an independent hostile re-check, since I have no review of the final merged version.\n- **HK-3 (#798, per-plugin workspace trust, marked partial):** under security review, mainly whether workspace plugin code can run without approval of that exact file.\n- **Not yet reviewed:** #801 (BG-2 crash recovery) and #803 (BG-3 abuse model), both from other agents.\n\n**Before an RC:**\n- re-measure the readiness inventory;\n- bump the version and write the changelog and release notes;\n- dispatch the real-LSP-server and real-project smoke workflows on the release tip.\n\nAfter the RC, the single merge to `main` and the stable release follow."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2508,"cache_read_input_tokens":304223,"output_tokens":424,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2508,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":304223,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_inp