nce on a race in my new assertion. That is fixed in the second commit and passed five runs after.\n- **Gates:** the full requested list, `tsc`, the complexity gate, `check_invariants`, `check_doc_versions` and the schema `--check` pass.\n\n## What breaks for existing project hooks\n\n- Any non-listed program (including absolute paths outside the workspace), `--require`/`--import` preloads, and `ksh`/`fish`/`php`/`deno`/`bun` are now invalid.\n- Scripts that load siblings relative to their own location break (`require(\"./lib\")`, a `.js` ES module relying on the workspace `package.json`).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>630276</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>31</tool_uses><duration_ms>1253097</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"3f397738-7144-4b81-b22f-b1a7c90930c7","timestamp":"2026-11-24T23:42:09.734Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mwvbje3o-2fad76a4"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPromptId":"230e7041-f912-445f-8b03-1cc7a9ae2033","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":40,"turnIndex":293},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
