{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChNe4YPffSwnYoFmSgeZh","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b"}]}
{"parentUuid":"1a542ad2-9950-43fd-b22e-c393cf7b1b8e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNe4YPffSwnYoFmSgeZh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The HK-1 pinning fix is open as #805 (nothing merged since #802), and an independent hostile review of it is running. #805 stays unmerged until that verdict is posted. The review of the MT-2 registry (#804) is also still running. I haven't re-run the builder's test counts myself.\n\nThe fix covers both blockers from the hostile check:\n- **Allowlist.** Project hooks are accepted only as a pinned workspace script run directly, or a short list of interpreters followed by a pinned script with a few harmless options.\n- **Verified copy.** Hooks run from a private copy of the exact bytes that were hashed.\n\nThe builder reports that the attack commands in the finding, plus about 80 variants, are refused, and that thirteen mutations each fail a test.\n\n**Cost to existing users, for the release notes:**\n- A project hooks file can no longer use programs outside the allowlist, absolute programs, `--require`/`--import` preloads, or `ksh`/`fish`/`php`/`deno`/`bun`.\n- Scripts that load sibling files relative to their own location break.\n- Those hooks move to the user's own hooks file.\n\nThe non-blocking items from the check are also in the PR:\n- Protected paths when the workspace is `~/.config/nexus`.\n- Refusing recursive deletion of a directory that contains a protected path.\n- Killing leftover hook children.\n- A rewritten `docs/HOOKS.md`.\n\nHK-3 (#798) still has two open blockers and waits on the same loading technique. #801 and #803 are not yet reviewed. v1.3.0 is not landed. The merge to `main` and the release haven't started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2981,"cache_read_input_tokens":333253,"output_tokens":542,"output_tokens_details":{"t