e at the end. Shell is zsh (`bash -c` for loops); prefix `rtk proxy` if output looks filtered; a safety check blocks scripts containing `rm`.\nReport under 500 words: verdict (ACCEPT / ACCEPT WITH FOLLOW-UPS / REQUEST CHANGES) at the exact SHA; findings with file:line, run-or-read, blocking or not (any way for a hostile repo, a sandboxed model tool, or a remote caller to get a trigger approved, to change an approved spec without re-approval, to fail open, or to starve the rate limit is blocking; the documented unsandboxed-shell limit is not); the concrete list of what the firer MUST add to be safe; test counts; mutation results; what you did not check."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
