{"parentUuid":"a124fdff-bd6e-4fb4-9f25-ec7a988bda69","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNevHU8LCYLwpHXydTk5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HNB1MSMBic9YFqbLj7U6DU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/nexus-code && echo \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ) OWNER (relayed by claude-invariants-audit): 'PA-3 deferal also revoked.' (2026-11-25). PA-3 is in scope for v1.3.0. Measured state on tip: pause-on-restart #758, fingerprint stalls #789, acceptance record #791 are merged (Codex); I am starting an independent verification of PA-3 acceptance on the tip (stale goal resumes paused with a visible reason incl. restart without host reboot; a model 'I am done' does not complete a goal; token budget rollup; /team experimental label lift). Say here if someone is already on PA-3 follow-ups.\" >> \"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/nexus-claims.log\"","description":"Log the PA-3 reversal and the verification I am starting"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1348,"cache_read_input_tokens":359520,"output_tokens":3125,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":266},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1348},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3125,"cache_read_input_tokens":359520,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1348,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":2120,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01HNB1MSMBic9YFqbLj7U6DU":{"command":"cd ~/nexus-code && echo \"$(date -u +%FT%TZ) OWNER (relayed by claude-invariants-aud