he secret out of the repository (environment or keychain); Origin is not authentication; persist limiter state privately with validation; check the workspace cap; exclude `.nexus/triggers.json` and `.git` from file-change events; re-check trust at fire time; run with unattended defaults.\n**Tests at that head:** new files 21, 15, 13, 11; `leak_guard` 6, `check_requirements` 28, `security` 14, `workspace_trust` 5, `hooks_self_approval` 10, `protocol_schema` 8; `tsc`, the complexity gate, invariants and doc versions clean. **Mutations:** no terminal, skip hash in spec, workspace-trust gate, `approveTrigger` gate, quarantine: caught; skip hash in CLI list and skipping a corrupt entry: survived; 0644 store accepted: unverified. Not checked: `--sandbox` reachability, other-uid stores, a real listener (there is none), Node 22.\nEOF\ngh pr comment 803 --body-file /tmp/claude-1000/-home-mike-nexus-code/43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b/scratchpad/rev803.md | tail -1; gh pr view 803 --json headRefName --jq .headRefName; gh pr view 798 --json headRefOid --jq '.headRefOid[0:8]'; gh pr view 798 --json comments --jq '.comments[-1].body[0:300]'","description":"Post the BG-3 trust review and read the branch name and the latest HK-3 comment"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChNez3mytL2wqfHoNtZQZ","requestRef":"2d9851d3-8a79-4645-9864-543378afc905","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"5m","type":"assistant","uuid":"f426eff0-2820-4839-a09c-0040bae499dd","timestamp":"2026-11-24T23:55:09.922Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
