{"parentUuid":"f03a1e52-8f94-486a-816b-e757b71bdddf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNhVR3CpeK53VeboL4Re","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The HK-1 builder pushed the shebang fix to #805 as `1222ef167`. It now reads the `#!` line the way the Linux kernel does: only space and tab separate fields, and any other control byte or non-ASCII byte refuses the line. It also dropped `NODE_PATH` from the hook environment. The builder reports tests for each hostile whitespace form, an end-to-end test with decoy directories, and mutations that each fail a test. I haven't re-run those myself.\n\nA fourth review is running, narrowly scoped. It tests the parser against the real kernel by generating shebang lines with every byte value in each position, plus long lines the kernel truncates, and checks that no accepted line makes the kernel run anything other than the trusted interpreter. #805 stays unmerged until it reports.\n\nStill running:\n- **#798 (HK-3):** hostile re-review.\n- **PA-3:** completion builder.\n- **BG-3:** my firer build.\n\nv1.3.0 is not landed. The merge to `main` and the release haven't started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2603,"cache_read_input_tokens":428192,"output_tokens":342,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2603},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":342,"cache_read_input_tokens":428192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2603,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2603,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"r