er file, which is what the benchmark measures; the test bound is 400 ms.\n4. **Changed guard**: no protected path, as decided. The notice is now `WARNING … NO LONGER IN FORCE: &lt;file&gt; changed`, once per session; the limit is documented in `PLUGINS.md` and `HOOKS.md`.\n5. **Store lock**: approve, revoke and `noteExtensionLoad` run under an `O_EXCL` lock file naming pid and start time. Four concurrent writer processes lose no entry.\n\n**Tests**: new `plugin_review_fixes` (7), three runs clean; 22 mutations, all killed. The full requested list passes, including `doctor` 60/60 with `cli/dist` built, `tsc`, the complexity gate (exit 0), `check_invariants`, `check_doc_versions` and both schema `--check` generators.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>903294</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>26</tool_uses><duration_ms>1364396</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
