ectories). Remove the false \"Docker needs no mask unless…\" sentence.\nRe-run: goal_driver_identity (20x for the zombie), goal_pa3_completion, goal_lifecycle, goal_ledger_propagation, sandbox_confine, sandbox_profiles, sandbox_cancel, sandbox_docker, sandbox_denial_events, every operation_* test, durable_continuity, runner_examples and schedule_examples (after `npm --prefix cli run build`), security, leak_guard, check_requirements; tsc; the complexity gate (exit code); check_invariants; check_doc_versions. Changed/new test files three times. Commit `fix(goal): <what>` + `Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>`; push. Report under 200 words with the commit hash."}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011ChNoM57MjhY7axR8FmphR","requestRef":"cdb2a439-dbf3-483c-9fa8-98cc7d4558c2","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b7b1ffa-7594-4281-b176-e547b2116fb6","timestamp":"2026-11-25T01:45:00.173Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
