\"no mask\" sentence is gone.\n\nEach new guard failed a test when I removed it: tasks-only mask (bwrap and Docker), no pre-create (bwrap and Docker), non-recursive scan.\n\n`tsc`, the complexity gate (exit 0), `check_invariants` and `check_doc_versions` pass. The changed test files passed three times each. The listed suites, including `runner_examples` and `schedule_examples` after a build, pass with one exception. `sandbox_denial_events` fails under the default `TMPDIR` (a stray `/tmp/.git` on this host, \"Git metadata is unavailable\") and passes with `TMPDIR=/dev/shm`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>311677</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>22</tool_uses><duration_ms>1107509</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
