{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChNuSpm2MbX9gzidNDR1e","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","listed":["msg_011ChNuRQfuE9tBmZcdRkk41"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"2a43f3c9-2509-46b0-abad-b98693266d55","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNuSpm2MbX9gzidNDR1e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The re-review of the PA-3 sandbox follow-up (#811) came back accept with follow-ups, and it's posted. The security result is good: the attacks that forged host goal state on the release branch now fail on this head. The builder is fixing two follow-ups before I mark the draft ready.\n\n**What closed, run with real bwrap and real Docker:**\n- A state root that doesn't exist yet. A sandboxed command created and planted it on the host before; the root is now created first and masked.\n- Renaming an ancestor of a nested state root.\n- A symlinked state root.\n- With the workspace at `/`, `/var` or a grandparent, renaming home now fails with a busy error.\n\n**One of the review's findings contradicts my worry.** The reviewer could not reproduce the rename of home itself when the workspace is the parent of home. That rename already fails on the release branch. The builder was right about that.\n\n**Follow-ups, being fixed:**\n- **Read-only sandbox regression:** the read-only profile with the workspace set to home now fails closed every time (`bwrap: Can't create file …/.nexus`). The existing read-only test only checked for \"no secret leaked\", so a sandbox error passed it. The builder fixes the mount and the assertion.\n- **State root outside home:** when the state root is outside home and the workspace is inside it, `tasks/` is readable in the sandbox (writes fail). The builder also masks `tasks/` there and adds the missing Docker test.\n- **Weak test:** the parent-of-home test passes without the pins, so I asked for a test that fails without them.\n\nThe reviewer found no regressions for ordinary sandboxed work. A full unattended job end to end was not run.\n\nStill running: the BG-3 firer builder and this PA-3 follow-up. v1.3.0 is not landed. The merge to `main` and the release haven't started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3098,"cache_read_input_tokens":536481,"output_tokens":604,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3098,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":604,"cache_read_input_tokens":536481,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3098,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3098},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChNuSpYP9Xg6JQ8MSeS59","requestRef":"9dcbce88-989c-4b43-a39b-757a230aa77d","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b5a053c-13b2-4d8d-8247-7880f7a57a79","timestamp":"2026-11-25T03:04:39.143Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
