{"parentUuid":"ecc17605-cc3a-4e45-99e4-a14f2cfd0f42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChNxJLmuk68s8ZAjSzWKt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019FWEJ857GKv6un6hvPo1i9","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"a317b41792fa50650","summary":"HK-3 print-site and notice follow-ups","message":"HK-3 fixes merged (#810, 17b891b6). Remaining non-blocking follow-ups from the re-review of #808/f375865e (comment on #808): do them on a NEW branch `v1/hk3-printsites` from origin/release/v1.3.0 in worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/hk3g (`git -C ~/nexus-code worktree add -b v1/hk3-printsites ~/nexus-wt/hk3g origin/release/v1.3.0`, symlink cli/node_modules from ~/nexus-code/cli, copy core/target/release binaries from ~/nexus-wt/ls1b/core/target/release). Each with a test that fails without it (mutate a copy, restore from it): (1) unescaped print sites: `doctor.ts` `plugins.config` (~1243-1262) raw plugin file paths; `index.ts:~1168` (`plugins revoke`); the HK-2 install/verify/list-installed output in `plugins_cli.ts` (~153-220); the project-hooks notice; apply the shared `core/printable.ts` helper everywhere a name/path/error from a plugin or repo is printed (grep every `console.`/`stderr.write`/doctor evidence in plugin/hook/doctor code and list sites you checked); (2) `printableRefusal` handles C0/C1 but not bidi, and `printable` omits U+FFF9–FFFB and the U+E0000 tag block: make ONE helper escape C0, DEL, C1, bidi (U+061C, U+200E/F, U+202A-E, U+2066-9), zero-width/format (U+200B-D, U+2060, U+FEFF, U+00AD), interlinear annotation U+FFF9-FB, tags U+E0000-E007F, line/paragraph separators U+2028/9, and lone surrogates; tests on exact bytes; (3) symlinked HOME with absent operator plugin dirs: the real-path spelling of `~/.nexus/plugins` / `~/.config/nexus/plugins` must be a protected path too (realpath the parent that exists + append), tests incl. symlinked HOME; (4) a changed JS plugin file must get the same louder \"NO LONGER IN FORCE: <file> changed\" notice (once per session) as hooks/manifest plugins, not only the generic pending notice; (5) `nexus plugins list` and doctor must mention skipped operator plugin directories (workspace = HOME) with the fix; (6) trust-store lock stale takeover must be atomic: take over via rename of the stale lock file to a unique name then O_EXCL create, so two takers cannot both win; test with 8 concurrent processes over 50 rounds; if `/proc` is unavailable the pid check must not read \"always stale\": fall back to treating a lock younger than 30 s as live. Run the plugin/hook/doctor/trust tests (`ls cli/test | grep -iE 'plugin|hook|trust|doctor|printable'`), security, leak_guard, check_requirements, tsc, the complexity gate (exit code), check_invariants, check_doc_versions; new/changed tests three times. Commit `fix(plugins): <what>` + `Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>`; push with a plain `git push -u origin v1/hk3-printsites` (never force); report under 200 words with the hash. I open a draft PR, review, then merge.","type":"message","recipient":"a317b41792fa50650","recipient_kind":"agent","content":"HK-3 fixes merged (#810, 17b891b6). Remaining non…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":640,"cache_read_input_tokens":553223,"output_tokens":1720,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":86},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":640,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1720,"cache_read_input_tokens":553223,"cache_creation_input_tokens":640,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":640},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics