ust mention skipped operator plugin directories (workspace = HOME) with the fix; (6) trust-store lock stale takeover must be atomic: take over via rename of the stale lock file to a unique name then O_EXCL create, so two takers cannot both win; test with 8 concurrent processes over 50 rounds; if `/proc` is unavailable the pid check must not read \"always stale\": fall back to treating a lock younger than 30 s as live. Run the plugin/hook/doctor/trust tests (`ls cli/test | grep -iE 'plugin|hook|trust|doctor|printable'`), security, leak_guard, check_requirements, tsc, the complexity gate (exit code), check_invariants, check_doc_versions; new/changed tests three times. Commit `fix(plugins): <what>` + `Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>`; push with a plain `git push -u origin v1/hk3-printsites` (never force); report under 200 words with the hash. I open a draft PR, review, then merge."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChNxJLbk9uaXgdoH5JHZE","requestRef":"17b13cbb-888a-4b6c-bdba-14c9c084ecd6","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"e38632ab-1164-4220-9666-f6ead916b3f3","timestamp":"2026-11-25T03:42:09.503Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"v1/bg3-trust-abuse-model","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
